    "detailed_description": "This is a match 3 game with a dog theme. The game has an innovative goal achievement system. <br />\r\n   By matching the same elements, the dog's walking energy is collected. Once the energy is obtained, the four direction buttons are activated.Using a directional button, the dog can be guided in four directions to help the dog reach its home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n  There are also three other types of mini-games, and a bonus game. <br />\r\n  The bonus game is similar to The Pac-Man game, in which the dog needs to dodge crabs that are tracking him and collect all the bones that the dog likes to eat in order to win.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n  Three mini games are jigsaw puzzle, find different and memory games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n  In addition, the game also provides some cute dog pictures that can be copied and used as electronic postcards and desktop backgrounds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n  Cute puppies are looking forward to your help.",
